Z||000000||Wolfhound||04-06-2001||09:13 PM||||I replaced the fuel pump and it fired up!<BR>Ran strange and I replaced the front three plugs. It ran fairly well then. <P>I ran it up to about 4 grand and it idled at 1000 +or-. <P>Now I wan't to clean it up. Soooo, I drive it down and take of the trunk lid and replaced the rear plugs.<P>IT has not failed to crank when I turn the key???? But that is it. My injectors on the rail aren't fireing???<P>So I started drinking Bud and had a conference with my assistant mechanics.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Help_1.JPG">   <P>I have tried to check connections down to the steering column. What am I missing. Am I going to have to shoot this car or just threaten it.<P>Just kidding. But I,m missing somthing right in front of my eyes.<P><BR>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 04-06-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 04-06-2001).]||||reg||1
